prompt:
Write a concise Markdown description for the ${entityType} "${entityId}".
Rules: - Use plain Markdown only. No frontmatter, no code blocks, no XML/JSON. - Use [[wiki-links]] for related entities. - Be specific and data-driven; avoid generic phrases. - People: 2-4 paragraphs covering expertise and concrete contributions. - Topic/area: 1-2 paragraphs plus bullet list of key themes.
Entity data: ${entityData} ${extraInstructions}
